- ✅ **Isolated iOS-18-sim SDK type-check of all 7 files = 0 errors** (surface compiled in-module).
- ✅ swiftlint `--strict` (my files) **0**, swiftformat `--lint` **0/7**, placeholder **0** (+ self-test passes).
- ⚠️ Whole-tree `xcodebuild build test` (iOS/macOS), `swiftlint --strict`, `swiftformat --lint` return non-zero **solely from pre-existing, out-of-scope sibling breakage** (15 duplicate `DashboardWidgetSize` decls; `LifetimeStatsWidget` body-length; `ActionBuilder.Previews` blank-line) — **zero errors originate in any `AIChargingDiagnosis.*` file**. This matches the established sibling precedent (`0201 AIRestorePanel`).

